  "description": "The extraction job follows the **ABI\u20113** template defined for the **CustomerDataMigration** project, targeting **SQL Server\u202f2019**. The template is set to the **extract** phase, uses the **full** pattern, reads from a **viw** source, and is implemented as a **single** run (template version\u202f1). The accompanying metadata schema is also at version\u202f1.  \n\nThe source object is the view **dbo.Customer** (schema\u202fdbo, name\u202fCustomer). Its data will be loaded into the data\u2011warehouse table **dw.Customer**, which resides in the **dw** schema of the **DataWarehouseDB** database accessed via the connection named **DW_Connection** (connection string: `Server=dw.example.com;Database=DataWarehouseDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`). The destination table is defined to create a primary key (CreatePrimaryKey\u202f=\u202f1) on the column **CustomerID**. The table columns are: **CustomerID** (INT), **FirstName** (NVARCHAR(50)), **LastName** (NVARCHAR(50)), **Email** (NVARCHAR(100)), and **CreatedDate** (DATETIME2).  \n\nAll ancillary connections required for the migration are documented: the metadata store uses **MetaDB** (`Server=meta.example.com;Database=MetadataDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`), logging writes to **LogDB** (`Server=log.example.com;Database=LoggingDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`), staging data lands in **StagingDB** (`Server=staging.example.com;Database=StagingDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`), configuration settings are held in **ConfigDB** (`Server=config.example.com;Database=ConfigDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`), and the data\u2011warehouse itself connects through **DataWarehouseDB** (`Server=dw.example.com;Database=DataWarehouseDB;Trusted_Connection=True;`). Helper utilities are available via two additional connections: **Helper1** (`Server=helper1.example.com;Database=HelperDB1;Trusted_Connection=True;`) and **Helper2** (`Server=helper2.example.com;Database=HelperDB2;Trusted_Connection=True;`).",
  "reference_json": {
    "ABI3": {
      "Template": {
        "Phase": "extract",
        "Pattern": "full",
        "Source": "viw",
        "Implementation": "single",
        "Version": 1
      },
      "Metadata": {
        "Version": 1
      },
      "Project": {
        "Name": "CustomerDataMigration",
        "TargetSQLPlatformVersion": "SQL Server 2019"
      }
    },
    "Object": {
      "SourceObject": {
        "Schema": "dbo",
        "Name": "Customer",
        "FullName": "dbo.Customer"
      },
      "DestinationTable": {
        "Connection": {
          "Name": "DW_Connection",
          "Database": "DataWarehouseDB",
          "ConnectionString": "Server=dw.example.com;Database=DataWarehouseDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
        },
        "Schema": "dw",
        "Name": "Customer",
        "FullName": "dw.Customer",
        "CreatePrimaryKey": 1,
        "Columns": [
          {
            "Name": "CustomerID",
            "DataType": "INT"
          },
          {
            "Name": "FirstName",
            "DataType": "NVARCHAR(50)"
          },
          {
            "Name": "LastName",
            "DataType": "NVARCHAR(50)"
          },
          {
            "Name": "Email",
            "DataType": "NVARCHAR(100)"
          },
          {
            "Name": "CreatedDate",
            "DataType": "DATETIME2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "PrimaryKeyColumns": [
        "CustomerID"
      ]
    },
    "Connections": {
      "Metadata": {
        "Name": "MetaDB",
        "Database": "MetadataDB",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=meta.example.com;Database=MetadataDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Log": {
        "Name": "LogDB",
        "Database": "LoggingDB",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=log.example.com;Database=LoggingDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Staging": {
        "Name": "StagingDB",
        "Database": "StagingDB",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=staging.example.com;Database=StagingDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Configuration": {
        "Name": "ConfigDB",
        "Database": "ConfigDB",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=config.example.com;Database=ConfigDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "DataWarehouse": {
        "Name": "DataWarehouseDB",
        "Database": "DataWarehouseDB",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=dw.example.com;Database=DataWarehouseDB;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Helpers": [
        {
          "Name": "Helper1",
          "Database": "HelperDB1",
          "ConnectionString": "Server=helper1.example.com;Database=HelperDB1;Trusted_Connection=True;"
        },
        {
          "Name": "Helper2",
          "Database": "HelperDB2",
          "ConnectionString": "Server=helper2.example.com;Database=HelperDB2;Trusted_Connection=True;"
        }
      ]
    }
